  "details": "<p>A. Mau records the funereal inscription as reading: \"To the memory of Publius Mancius Diogenes, freedman of Publius Mancius; (the monument was erected) in accordance with the terms of his will, under the direction of Mancia Doris, freedwoman of Publius Mancius.\" Additional inscriptions name a Lucius Magius Celer and and a Caius Tampius Sabeinus.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The Tomb of Publius Mancius Diogenes in the Fondo Pacifico necropolis of Pompeii (FP5) was excavated in 1886-7. The site is now reinterred.",
